## 15. 状态流转

### 15.1 正常发布

```text
Incomplete
↓ 配置完整
Draft
↓ Publish now
Active
↓ End / 到达 End time
Ended
↓ Archive
Archived
```

### 15.2 定时发布

```text
Draft
↓ Schedule
Scheduled
↓ 到达 Start time
Active
↓ End / 到达 End time
Ended
```

### 15.3 暂停与恢复

```text
Active
↓ Pause
Paused
↓ Resume
Active
```

### 15.4 取消定时

```text
Scheduled
↓ Unschedule
Draft
```

### 15.5 复制问卷

```text
Draft / Active / Paused / Ended / Archived
↓ Duplicate
Draft
```

复制后生成一份新的 Survey，状态为 Draft，responses 不复制。

