## 16. Active 状态下的编辑规则

### 16.1 Active 且没有 responses

允许编辑：

```text
Questions
User-facing title
User-facing description
Audience
Schedule
Internal note
```

---

### 16.2 Active 且已有 responses

允许编辑：

```text
Audience
End time
Internal note
Display visibility
```

不允许编辑：

```text
Question title
Question type
Question options
Question order
Required setting
```

提示文案：

```text
This survey already has responses. Duplicate it to edit questions.
```

---

## 17. Ended 状态规则

Ended 后不允许重新变回 Active。

需要再次运行时，使用：

```text
Duplicate
```

Duplicate 后：

```text
生成新 Survey
状态为 Draft
不复制 responses
复制 questions / basic setup / audience / schedule 配置
```

